# INTEG QA — gates

**Артефакт:** с эпиком `memory-bank/integration/qa/<epic_id>/qa-YYYYMMDD-<slug>.yaml`; без — плоско. **FORBIDDEN** дубль `qa.yaml`+dated. @.cursor/rules/shared/epic-scoped-paths.mdc · `.cursor/templates/qa/epic-step.yaml`

## Gates

1. Lean load §7: ONE eNN §Contract + implement + diff; **не** полный `plan-*.md` в `load_now`
2. §0.11 + INTEG-CHECKLIST; contract drift = FAIL
2a. Brownfield: leftover mock/legacy/fallback check — PASS при leftover = FAIL. Канон: @.cursor/rules/shared/workflow-legacy-fallback-cleanup.mdc §5
2b. **Behavior smoke** при agent/hook/gate/CLI FR — suite alone недостаточен. @.cursor/rules/shared/workflow-behavior-first.mdc §6
3. Tests (HARD): Hub (dev-hub self-test) — **полный pytest репозитория** `bin/pytest -q --tb=line` (или `timeout -k 10s 300s .venv/bin/pytest -q --tb=line`) **без** path/nodeid/`-k` + parent-only Vitest + parent-only scenario (Playwright; epic-scoped pytest **не** заменяет full); Managed project — full capability checks (`test.full`, `typecheck.full`, `lint.full`) с валидным typed execution evidence. FRONT runners **parent only**
4. P0/P1 user-visible без scenario → **write** before PASS
5. **fail|blocked:** создать/merge `memory-bank/integration/bugfix/<epic_id>/bugfix-queue.yaml` (`epic-bugfix-queue/v1`, blockers 1:1; старые done сохранить) + Handoff с queue в `load_now` — `finish-doc-router.md`
5a. **Anti-ratchet / freeze (HARD):** Frozen QA checklist (`checklist_sha256`) SoT; blockers only `suite_red|ac_gap|leftover|orphan_ref|prior_open|behavior_smoke:`; after BUGFIX `prior_only`; ≥3 cycles same sha → NEED_HUMAN.

## Abort

- PASS без scenario · subagent runs vitest/playwright · FORBIDDEN: голый pytest (hub) / raw runner fallback without capability_checks → reject/FAIL
- PASS при **только** epic-scoped / path / `-k` pytest (hub; нет full-repo команды) → **FAIL** (`suite_not_full`)
- PASS при leftover mock/legacy entrypoint / fallback → FAIL
- PASS при agent/hook/gate/CLI FR без behavior smoke → FAIL
- blockers without eligible class / checklist_sha256 drift → FAIL
- fail/blocked без валидной bugfix queue в `load_now` → FAIL
